    "explanation": "Varian is good on Maps where team fights happen not only at the Objective but also in other locations of the battlefield because he can gain advantage from the fact that his Heroic Abilities have a really short cooldown and weak on Maps where there is only one big team fight at the Objective because the enemy team can play safe the rest of the time."
